Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4b)
-----------------------------------------------------

Changes made to the upstream source in this fork:

1. Removed every non-Windows backend. Upstream ships darwin (Objective-C),
   linux (C/GTK) and their cgo bridges; this fork keeps only systray.go and
   systray_windows.go, because gpsync-tray is built for Windows alone and the
   project builds without cgo.

2. Added double-click support. Upstream's wndProc handles WM_LBUTTONUP and
   WM_RBUTTONUP by opening the menu and offers no application-level hook for
   a double click. This fork handles WM_LBUTTONDBLCLK and adds
   SetOnDoubleClick, which gpsync-tray uses to open its dashboard.

3. Removed unused API surface and adjusted logging to suit a single embedding
   application.

